## Worksheet

**F1 — Core loop:** Single `G` object; `rnd(G)` (mulberry32-style, uses `G.rngState`) is the only randomness source; `resolveTurn()` runs storm→production→consumption→events in fixed documented order. Score 2.

**F2 — Map:** `genMap()` builds 8x8 `G.map` via `rnd(G)` (seed-derived); `whyNotBuild()` checks `d.terr.indexOf(t.t)`; `adjInfo()` feeds `plan()` multipliers that change actual output. Score 2.

**F3 — Economy:** Chains ore→metal (`mine`→`forge`), ash→soil→food (`collector`→`composter`→`greenhouse`); `caps(G)` enforced in `give()`; overflow tracked in `G.spill`, logged in `resolveTurn`. Score 2.

**F4 — Population:** Colonist records `{skill,xp,fatigue,morale,job,at}`; `eff()` reads `p.skill`/`fatigueF(p.fatigue)` in `labourAt()`. Score 2.

**F5 — Needs:** Consumption in `resolveTurn` step 8; shortfall calls `moraleAll(G,-d)`; morale feeds `moraleF()` in `eff()`; morale trends toward `set` target (recoverable, not instant). Score 2.

**F6 — Research:** 12 nodes in `TECH`; `techState()` enforces `req.every`; `pay(G,t.cost)` deducts cost; effects read in `techOut()`, `stormMitigation()`, `cisternCut`, `unlocked()`. Score 2.

**F7 — Events:** 15 events in `EVENTS`; weighted roll in `fireEvent()`; 5 choice events (wanderers/tunnel/sickness/rations/mechanic) with divergent `apply()` branches; `G.evCd` cooldown checked in filter. Score 2.

**F8 — Trade:** `priceOf()` = `BASEP*idx*scarcity(stockpile)`; `driftMarket()` random-walks `market.idx`; `c.inv`/`c.purse` finite, checked in `doTrade()` both buy/sell branches. Score 2.

**F9 — Hazard:** `doStorm()` fires every `STORM_EVERY` turns, `sev` grows with `turn`; `integF(b)` scales `plan()` output; `stormMitigation` (tech) and `shieldOf` (windbreak) reduce damage; `repairBld()` spends parts, restores `integ`. Score 2.

**F10 — Save/load:** `serialize(G)`→textarea; `deserialize()`/`validate()` checks version, terrain, jobs, resources, shows error in `saveMsg`. Score 2.

**F11 — End conditions:** `checkEnd()` — lose on `pops.length===0`, win on `turn>WIN_TURN && needsMet()`; `scoreOf()` combines pop/tech/turns/stock/structures; `renderModal()` shows summary table. Score 2.

**F12 — UI:** `setTab()` switches panes; `log()` stores `t:G.turn`, rendered as "T"+t; `data-tip`/`showTip` extensive tooltips; keydown handles Space/1-6; `@media(min-width:820px)` + auto-fit grids adapt layout. Score 2.

**F13 — Dev panel:** `runTests()` has 40 real invariant checks (caps, roster ids, prereqs, research delta, save round-trip); `runBench()`/`simulate()` runs 200-turn headless loop, prints `stateHash`. Score 2.

**G1:** `techOut()` reads `G.tech.sifting` etc., multiplies in `plan()` via `p.tm`, consumed every turn in `runBld()`. Score 4.

**G2:** Shortfall in consumption step → `moraleAll(G,-d)` → `moraleF(p)` used in `eff()` → `labourAt()` reduced next turn. Score 4.

**G3:** `doStorm()` reduces `b.integ` → `integF(b)` scales `plan()` output → `repairBld()` spends parts, sets `integ=100`, restoring output immediately. Score 4.

**G4:** `priceOf()` reads `scarcity(G,r)` (stockpile-based) and `market.idx` (drifted every turn by `driftMarket()`). Score 4.

**G5:** `wanderers`/`tunnel` choices call `take/give` on `G.res` and push to `G.pops`/mutate `fatigue`, not just `log()`. Score 4.

